Steel_Drill.name = Steel Drill
Steel_Drill.description = An electric drill. Equivalent to an iron pickaxe. Hope you brought ear muffs.\n\nPlace in an upgrade station to view stats.
Cobalt_Drill.name = Cobalt Drill
Cobalt_Drill.description = An electric drill. Equivalent to a cobalt pickaxe. The close presence of magical metal places greater strain on the power buffer, requiring more energy per operation.\n\nPlace in an upgrade station to view stats.
Adamantite_Drill.name = Adamantite Drill
Adamantite_Drill.description = An electric drill. Equivalent to an adamantite pickaxe. The heavy, magical drill bit requires a substantial amount of power to operate adequately.\n\nPlace in an upgrade station to view stats.
